{
  "_comment": [
    "Sources for the era/country action-card art on /actions.",
    "Keys are '<era>/<slug>' (era-generic) or '<era>/<country>/<slug>' (national).",
    "Every entry is public domain or a free CC/open licence — see `license` and `credit`.",
    "Adding a national image also requires listing its slug in ERA_COUNTRY_SLUGS",
    "in src/lib/images/actionImages.ts, or the resolver will keep serving the generic.",
    "Optional `gravity` (a sharp position: top/north/bottom/…) moves the 2:1 card crop",
    "off centre; use it when the subject sits high or low in the frame.",
    "Eras 1991/1999/2007/2019/2023/2027 and the era-neutral set `neutral/<slug>` were added for 1.12.",
    "Optional `color: true` keeps the source in colour; the pre-2000 sets and the neutral set are greyscaled for one tonal treatment.",
    "Optional `page` is the Commons file page; `credit` is the attribution line shown in public/static/actions/CREDITS.md.",
    "Optional `revision: n` marks replaced art: the file is published as `<slug>-v<n>.webp` (new R2 object, the old one stays so cached URLs never show new art under an old name) and must also be listed in ACTION_ART_REVISIONS in src/lib/images/actionImages.ts."
  ],
